WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
- [Announcer:] WILDCARD WEEKEND...

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.625
Choose your matchup.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:08.875
- My stats are almost as good as Watt's!

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:13.875
- [Announcer:] Browns/Texans: FIGHT!

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:15.000
- Get over here.

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.250
- [Announcer:] Steelers/Bills: FIGHT!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.125
- Press "B" all you want, I’m NOT blocking.

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.875
- Careless... SLIDE!

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:28.000
- [Announcer:] Packers/Cowboys: FIGHT!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.250
- As a Packers QB...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.250
I eventually turn into a monster.

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:33.750
- [Announcer:] PLEASE ENTER CeeDee.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:35.875
- Uh-oh...

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.250
- [Announcer:] Rams/Lions: FIGHT!

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.416
- Eat Kneecaps!

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:41.000
- JERSEY... SWAP!!!

00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:45.125
- [Announcer:] EAGLES/BUCS: FIGHT!

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:47.250
- Tush Push! T-T-Tush Push! Tush Push!

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:49.000
- Stop spamming that one f--king move.

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:50.500
- [Announcer:] DOLPHINS/CHIEFS: LOCKED!

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.416
Enter friend’s Peacock password.

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:56.416
- Can't. Perform. So. Cold.

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:58.500
- [Announcer:] TEXANS WIN!

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:03.291
- Why...won't...you...just...die...

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.500
Whoaaa--

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.875
- [Announcer:] BILLS ADVANCE!

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.416
- Wait, that was a playoff game?

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:10.125
- Love bomb!

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:10.916
- Ugh!

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:11.875
- [Announcer:] PACKERS WIN!

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.166
- Here we go.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.750
- [Announcer:] LIONS WIN!
- [Lions fans chanting:] Jared Goff! Jared Goff!

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.625
- [Announcer:] OH DEAR LORD. CUT AWAY.

00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:23.291
- [Announcer:] EAGLES DEFEAT THEMSELVES!

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:25.375
- What a f--king meltdown.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.625
- Speedy Hill!

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.625
- THIS ISN'T THE FIRST TIME I'VE FROZEN OUT MY BROTHER.

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.000
- [Announcer:] FLAWLESS VICTORY.

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:37.416
- DIE, DIE, DIE.

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:39.500
- BYE WEEK MEANS UNLIMITED SCREEN TIME!

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.375
- [Announcer:] AND FLACCO’S ATTACK IS COMING BACK THE OTHER WAY…

00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:45.500
AGAIN!

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:48.416
LIONS FANS CRYING TEARS OF JOY…

00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:50.000
SENTIMENTALITY!

00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:53.750
PRESS “A” TO CHASE TOMLIN OUT OF THE PRESS CONFERENCE!

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:56.250
- [Journalist:] Mike, Mike! You have one year left on your contract! Mike!

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.625
- [Announcer:] Baker, finish him!

00:01:58.625 --> 00:02:00.666
- [Baker:] Sirianni? Hurts?

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:01.416
Who do you mean?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.875
- My dad's here, bye!

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:05.125
- Alright, see you in Vegas.

